# React Components Submodule

This is a shared component library. Changes here affect all consuming applications.

## Directory Structure

```
components/         # UI components
hooks/              # Custom React hooks
helpers/            # Component helper functions
types/              # TypeScript interfaces
assets/             # Static assets
```

## Component Guidelines

### Export Pattern

Use default exports for components:

```typescript
export default function MyComponent(props: MyComponentProps) { ... }
```

### Props Interface

Define interfaces in `types/` directory:

```typescript
// types/my-component.ts
export interface MyComponentProps {
  required: string;
  optional?: number;
}
```

### Styling

- Use Tailwind CSS classes
- Use `combineClassNames` from javascript-functions for conditional classes
- Avoid inline styles

## Hook Guidelines

- Hooks must start with `use`
- File name should match hook name
- Document return types explicitly

## Dependencies

- `@headlessui/react` - Accessible UI primitives
- `@nextui-org/react` - Tooltip component
- `@tabler/icons-react` - Icon library

